<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:03]<b>1<b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:05]Will tourism change the island of Skopelos?</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:09]Yes, I think it’ll change it a lot.</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:014]<b>2<b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:15]Where will you live when you’re older?</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:18]I think I’ll live by the coast.</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:22.8]<b>3<b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:24]Where are they going on holiday next year?</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:27.5]I think they’ll go to Greece.</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:32]<b>4<b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:33.8]Do you think you’ll pass the exam?</p>]]></text>
